r contemporaneous' rule); the FY2024 annual report's own restated FY2023 comparative would instead show a NEGATIVE ROE around -24.19% (loss on lower, restated equity) -- both figures are preserved, only the contemporaneous one is stored as this dataset's value; see the roe_pct.note for FY2023 and 2023_Q4.json's period_note / sources.json for the full restatement finding. npl_ratio_pct/ldr_pct/car_pct are the bank's own reported figures for every year except FY2015's npl_ratio_pct, which is calculated directly from classified investments (BDT 0.887137m) over gross investments (rounds to 0.00%, the bank's own summary tables for this specific year were not legibly extractable, see sources.json). No FY2025 period exists: Union Bank was declared non-viable by Bangladesh Bank effective 5 November 2025 and merged, together with EXIM Bank, First Security Islami Bank, Global Islami Bank and Social Islami Bank, into a new state-owned entity, Sammilito Islami Bank PLC -- confirmed via a time-boxed multi-source check on 2026-08-26; see sources.json for the full finding.",
